  "guideModulePersonalizedStartStep1": "Your learning goal changes the order of recommendations and this checklist. It does not change difficulty, XP, or rewards.",
  "guideModulePersonalizedStartStep2": "Learning path starting point resets where your learning path begins after you confirm it. Browse level only filters libraries and scenarios.",
  "guideModuleLearnStep1": "Hangeul overview, cards, and writing are separate tabs. Open only the practice you want.",
  "guideModuleLearnStep2": "Learn also brings together listening, pronunciation, and level-based scenarios. Categories come from the current catalog; this guide never guesses one.",
  "guideModuleLearnStep3": "A destination may show its own contextual tip. The guide never sends you through several routes in sequence or resets tips you already completed.",
  "guideModuleMyBookStep1": "Choose camera or gallery only after you open capture. Text recognition runs on your device, and you check the extracted Korean before analysis.",
  "guideModuleMyBookStep2": "If you choose Analyze, extracted text may be sent to an analysis service in the EU. The photographed image stays on your device.",
  "guideModuleMyBookStep3": "Supported page results, words, expressions, grammar, and sentences can be saved with today’s tools. This guide does not promise or generate new AI exercises.",
  "guideModuleCardsStep1": "Tap a learning card to turn it over. Swipe to move to the next card.",
