  "guideModuleCardsStep3": "The study library separates favorites, saved items, and items due today. Today’s direct review route supports due words; other saved types stay visible without pretending to be word review.",
  "guideModuleGamesStep1": "Hints help during a game, but using a hint is not recorded as independent recall or mastery.",
  "guideModuleGamesStep2": "XP, personal records, and quest progress come only from supported completed activities. Looking at this guide grants nothing.",
  "guideModuleGamesStep3": "Stamps can connect to bojagi and decorating items. Open the Hanok area to see the stamp book, inventory, and room tools that are currently available.",
